# Line ending conversion is disabled for the whole repository on purpose.
#
# tools/build_public_paper.py embeds a SHA-256 over the raw bytes of the
# manuscript, the claim register, and the quantitative source artifacts, and
# tools/reproduce_public_evidence.py hashes released arrays the same way. If Git
# rewrote CRLF to LF on commit or back again on checkout, those bytes would
# differ between a Windows and a Linux clone and the --check runs would fail on
# a clone that is in fact correct.
#
# Every file is therefore stored and checked out byte for byte identical.
* -text

# Marked explicitly so no future attribute change can touch them.
*.npz binary
*.pt binary
*.pdf binary
*.csv binary
*.jsonl binary
